(7586573, 1221405, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this colorful and cheerful arrangement of kitchen items. The yellow pitcher goes well with the springtime colors and flowers of the dishcloth. The stacked geese/duck bowls adds a touch of playfulness but also adds to the feel that this is a country kitchen. Nice work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this colorful and cheerful arrangement of kitchen items. The yellow pitcher goes well with the springtime colors and flowers of the dishcloth. The stacked geese/duck bowls adds a touch of playfulness but also adds to the feel that this is a country kitchen. Nice work!', '2018-07-29 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586577, 1221221, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic light, composition, and action showing a baker at work! Love the captured action of the flour falling from the sifter down to the ball of dough that will become a loaf a bread once it is baked.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic light, composition, and action showing a baker at work! Love the captured action of the flour falling from the sifter down to the ball of dough that will become a loaf a bread once it is baked.', '2018-07-29 14:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586580, 1221367, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I see the beginnings of a delicious peach pie in the making! I really like the composition and capture of this baker rolling out dough for the pie crust. Off to the left are three tasty peaches at the ready for this recipe. Lighting and angle are also great!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I see the beginnings of a delicious peach pie in the making! I really like the composition and capture of this baker rolling out dough for the pie crust. Off to the left are three tasty peaches at the ready for this recipe. Lighting and angle are also great!', '2018-07-29 14:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586581, 1221313, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful still life arrangement showcasing the tools and ingredients needed to make and bake cookies! Love the addition of the star shaped cookie cutter for it tells the viewer what is being made and it is an interesting shape to add to the mix in this still life. You have fantastic lighting and great details in this photo!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful still life arrangement showcasing the tools and ingredients needed to make and bake cookies! Love the addition of the star shaped cookie cutter for it tells the viewer what is being made and it is an interesting shape to add to the mix in this still life. You have fantastic lighting and great details in this photo!', '2018-07-29 14:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7586584, 1221176, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the warm lighting here that compliments the scene of this kitchen of a bygone era! The warm yellow/orange light in the hearth area invokes the imagery of a fire going as the pot hangs over the log ready for a meal to be made.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the warm lighting here that compliments the scene of this kitchen of a bygone era! The warm yellow/orange light in the hearth area invokes the imagery of a fire going as the pot hangs over the log ready for a meal to be made.', '2018-07-29 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
