(7586987, 1221379, 56502, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this is for - never seen before.<br/>The edge of the red handle looks a bit odd. Probably some issue with a selection during image processing, I guess.</td>', 'I wonder what this is for - never seen before.The edge of the red handle looks a bit odd. Probably some issue with a selection during image processing, I guess.', '2018-07-30 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
