(7587445, 1221376, 87808, '<td valign="top">Maybe tilting the can opener a little on its side, would have brought some more lines and interest to the shot. Those jagged edges would have complimented the grittiness you have going on with the wall, counter and BW. 6</td>', 'Maybe tilting the can opener a little on its side, would have brought some more lines and interest to the shot. Those jagged edges would have complimented the grittiness you have going on with the wall, counter and BW. 6', '2018-07-31 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
