(7587448, 1221423, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very simple, but very well done, I really like it!</td>', 'Very simple, but very well done, I really like it!', '2018-07-31 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587452, 1221415, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, the warmth of the copper pot is lovely . The only thing I would say, is my eye is immediately drawn to the shadow on the right top side and I only say that, as I have boys who find ''willys'' in everything and laugh hysterically, cus it is soooo funny at their age (roll eyeballs). So I immediately spotted that. Now I have seen it, I can not un-see it. Sorry. But a solid 7 for the rest of teh lovely shot.</td>', 'This is lovely, the warmth of the copper pot is lovely . The only thing I would say, is my eye is immediately drawn to the shadow on the right top side and I only say that, as I have boys who find ''willys'' in everything and laugh hysterically, cus it is soooo funny at their age (roll eyeballs). So I immediately spotted that. Now I have seen it, I can not un-see it. Sorry. But a solid 7 for the rest of teh lovely shot.', '2018-07-31 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7587453, 1221176, 87808, '<td valign="top">JMO, but a tighter crop on the left side all the way to the hearth, would have brought out the angle, DOF and tools much more. Cozy shot though, I like it.</td>', 'JMO, but a tighter crop on the left side all the way to the hearth, would have brought out the angle, DOF and tools much more. Cozy shot though, I like it.', '2018-07-31 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
