(7587456, 1221323, 87808, '<td valign="top">I am envious, you have 2 full sets! Half of mine are in the garden after being used for digging! Love the bright colours you have and the symmetry and that pop of salt/sugar is perfect!</td>', 'I am envious, you have 2 full sets! Half of mine are in the garden after being used for digging! Love the bright colours you have and the symmetry and that pop of salt/sugar is perfect!', '2018-07-31 13:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
